<title>USA: Endorex raises $2.0 mln in placement.</title>
<headline>Endorex raises $2.0 mln in placement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endorex Corp said it raised about $2.0 million in gross proceeds in the first tranche of a previously announced private placement.</p>
<p>Endorex, a biotechnology company developing immuno-pharmaceuticals to treat cancer and other diseases, said it issued and sold a total of 864,865 common shares.</p>
<p>Net proceeds after commissions and expenses were $1.74 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
